","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids November to December came in under 90% of normal in 41 of them. On that same middle, February to March ran 29% of normal in 2025 and 25% in 2026, while May to June 2026 came in at 165%. Every grid had its driest year in 1956, with grid 22928 at 45% of normal.</p>"}
